      "html": "<div>\n\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"ct-hero\">\n      <h2>Your Complete Trading System 🚀</h2>\n      <p>You've now learned everything from crypto basics to Elliott Waves. Here's how to combine it all into a real, repeatable trading strategy.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>🔗 The Full Analysis Framework</h3>\n    <div>\n      <div><div>1</div><div><strong>Macro View (Weekly/Monthly charts)</strong><br>What wave in the Elliott Cycle are we in? Bull or bear market? (Are we above/below 200 MA?)</div></div>\n      <div><div>2</div><div><strong>Trend Analysis (Daily chart)</strong><br>What's the trend? Higher highs/higher lows = uptrend. Draw your trend lines.</div></div>\n      <div><div>3</div><div><strong>Key Levels (4H chart)</strong><br>Mark your support and resistance levels. Where did price bounce before?</div></div>\n      <div><div>4</div><div><strong>Indicators (1H chart)</strong><br>Is RSI oversold near support? Is MACD showing a bullish cross? Is volume increasing?</div></div>\n      <div><div>5</div><div><strong>Entry Signal (15min/1H)</strong><br>Look for a bullish candlestick pattern (hammer, engulfing) at the support level as your actual entry trigger.</div></div>\n      <div><div>6</div><div><strong>Risk Management</strong><br>Place stop-loss just below support. Set take-profit at next resistance. Calculate R:R ≥ 1:2. Risk max 2% of account.</div></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>📖 A Real Trade Example</h3>\n    <div class=\"ct-card\">\n      <div class=\"ct-card-title\">✅ Example: BTC Trade Setup</div>\n      <table>\n        <tr><th>Step</th><th>What You See</th><th>Decision</th></tr>\n        <tr><td>Macro</td><td>BTC above 200 MA, Elliott Wave 2 correction ending</td><td>✅ Bullish bias</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Trend</td><td>Uptrend on daily. Higher highs.</td><td>✅ Only look for LONGS</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Key Level</td><td>Price at strong support ($95,000), tested 3x before</td><td>✅ Strong buy zone</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Indicators</td><td>RSI = 32 (oversold), MACD bullish cross forming</td><td>✅ Multiple confirmations</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Entry Signal</td><td>Bullish engulfing candle forms on 1H chart</td><td>✅ Enter here: $95,200</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Risk Mgmt</td><td>Stop-loss: $93,500 | Target: $101,000</td><td>✅ R:R = 1:3.4 — TAKE IT!</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>📅 The Trader's Daily Routine</h3>\n    <div class=\"ct-grid\">\n      <div class=\"ct-card\">\n        <div class=\"ct-card-title\">☀️ Pre-Market (Morning)</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Check overnight price action</li>\n          <li>Read crypto news (15 min max)</li>\n          <li>Mark key support/resistance for the day</li>\n          <li>Note any setups forming</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ct-card\">\n        <div class=\"ct-card-title\">🌙 Post-Market (Evening)</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Review all trades taken today</li>\n          <li>Write in trading journal</li>\n          <li>Did you follow your rules?</li>\n          <li>Set alerts for tomorrow's levels</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>🗺️ Your Learning Roadmap</h3>\n    <table>\n      <tr><th>Phase</th><th>Duration</th><th>Focus</th></tr>\n      <tr><td>📚 <strong>Study</strong></td><td>Month 1-2</td><td>Master this guide. Learn on paper (demo account). No real money yet!</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>🎮 <strong>Paper Trade</strong></td><td>Month 2-4</td><td>Practice on a demo account with fake money. Track every trade.</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>💵 <strong>Small Real Money</strong></td><td>Month 4-6</td><td>Start with tiny amounts. Focus on process, not profit.</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>📈 <strong>Scale Up</strong></td><td>Month 6+</td><td>Only increase size when consistently profitable for 3+ months.</td></tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <div class=\"ct-callout ct-callout--tip\">\n      <div class=\"ct-callout-label\">🏆 Final Words</div>\n      <p>You now have more crypto trading knowledge than 80% of beginners. Remember: <strong>the strategy is secondary to risk management and psychology.</strong> The best traders aren't the ones with the most complex strategies — they're the most disciplined ones.<br><br>\n      Start small. Be patient. Trust the process. 🚀</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ct-callout ct-callout--warn\">\n      <div class=\"ct-callout-label\">⚠️ Important Disclaimer</div>\n      <p>This guide is for educational purposes only. Crypto trading involves significant risk of loss. Never invest money you can't afford to lose. Always do your own research (DYOR) before making any financial decisions.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div>🎓</div>\n      <h2>Congratulations, trader!</h2>\n      <p>You've completed Crypto Trading 101</p>\n      <p>From Noob to Elliott Wave Trader 🌊</p>\n    </div>\n\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
